{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852746193813766144","content":"\"Let me tell you a secret, Speaker. We have gone, and are *still*, going through a constant threat to our health and well-being and life. It is *impossible* for us to be at our peaks.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T00:45:18.687000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-26T00:45:26.520000Z","id":"880251528542298133","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852746193813766144","content":"She listens a little to Finn's broadcast, and then makes a happy sigh. \"That was Hope. I'm sure you've met them. I wished for Hope and now I can see it being granted.\" She giggles.","created_at":"2021-08-26T00:48:23.573000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880252304010399785","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
