{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852746193813766144","content":"The Speaker takes a huge bite from his pizza and calls for a toast. \"For Arcania! For freedom! We will fight for those who have laid their lives for this city and will never forget them!\" He says joyously as he raises his mug of ale.","created_at":"2021-08-26T00:49:10.892000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880252502480670761","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852746193813766144","content":"(spirit session with Speaker, Irynx, and Paddy. Radar handwaved the duration cuz I just woke up teehee)","created_at":"2021-08-26T00:49:39.873000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880252624035790898","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852746193813766144","content":"\"I cannot argue with your logic there, so drink away. Just be sure you can still fight after this.\" The speaker says with a smile while taking a huge swig of ale.","created_at":"2021-08-26T00:50:33.411000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880252848590422106","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852746193813766144","content":"\"Yaaaay.\" Irynx steps up on to a table, wobbles a little. She gives a sheepish look, \"Sorry, Uncle Paddy.\"\n\nBut raises her glass in a toast anyway. \"Today, one thing will end, another will begin. Our actions will decide on which side we stand.\"\n\n\"I have spent years fighting. For good, for survival, for life and death.\"\n\nShe looks down towards the Speaker, keeps eye contact. \"Today, I will fight for another *minute* for all of you.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T00:53:10.590000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880253507846946886","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852746193813766144","content":"\"I'm fighting for more than a minute, I'll be fighting for our future.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T00:55:23.246000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880254064246534144","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
